    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d732">

                <pb facs="0847" n="727" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg727"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Pearson to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-02-06"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">February 6,
                    1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Pearson reports that protest against the terms of the settlement has been
                    made by Consul Norton, who declares that the demands of the United States are
                    satisfied only to a small degree.</p>
                <p>Reports that six accomplices have been condemned to imprisonment at Teheran and
                    in the event of any further outrage by the Kurd tribe they will be hanged.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
